WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Stars streak across the screen as the camera races through space.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
An alien Propagator fills the view, its grotesque red eye staring from pink flesh.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Hundreds of Propagators swarm in a writhing pink and purple mass.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Inside the Lunar Cry stream, the camera plunges through a torrent of creatures.

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
From orbit, the red Lunar Cry slams into the planet's surface, scarring the continents.

6
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The emptied moon hangs in the foreground. The planet floats beyond, battered but intact.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Back inside the stream, fanged creatures tumble through crimson chaos.

8
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The swarm thins. The Lunar Cry finally subsides.
